Note on game assets: ATLAS (Jarvis NMS Interface) is a fan-made AI assistant
interface for No Man's Sky. This license covers the original code, layout,
and design in this project only. Any imagery, icons, or other assets sourced
or adapted from No Man's Sky itself are the property of Hello Games and are
not covered by this license -- they're included here under fair-use
fan-project conventions. Anyone reusing this code should credit elegra1965
for the original work and source their own copies of any game assets rather
than relying on this license to cover them.

This is the sister working copy of the live ATLAS deploy
(ATLAS-netlify-deploy-v2.8, kept in sync in the same project folder) -- same
license applies to both.
